&oh=00_Af8u220iFseaODGmeOGNrCnUSh6DzhJl40_Ncp26PWR74g&oe=6A36A8A8"}, {"file_name": "screen3.png", "id": "258935755667723", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75297580_258935759001056_2813863870203173318_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hSUey-rgi04Q7kNvwEpCTcW&_nc_oc=AdpjDiUWXz0rXNBTRcEjhZ322z9WUjLgPArc15eGuMsbgWR4r3YT10u8_zEgwvUZ3qQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_gkOCocMh73TqKIezupFYTZW9sJtoJMhmEx6rgMi8YMA&oe=6A369912"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "38982658_535757437737335_5271675859752528110_n.png", "id": "816059002445368", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210893_816059005778701_1392764768497568274_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZMVL126HQqIQ7kNvwHivfQu&_nc_oc=AdoHTN_zAS_BfzOw_jlKDErSro2hKnbXLAIJKRbnNAfjzqI6wPY1trTyqfD_O5U7WIs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-eeMfrx8_GpIJXVFkQ9o9eOP8MeD4-p2M-wC2oGHegdA&oe=6A36C713"}, "display_name": "The Secret of Retropolis Demo", "keywords": [], "long_description": "The Secret of Retropolis is a VR narrative game of a new kind, a blend of classic point-and-click adventure with immersive cinematography. Embody the witty protagonist of a film noir plot. Meet unforgettable characters. Solve puzzles. Lose yourself in the retro-futuristic atmosphere.\n\nEXPERIENCE IN COMFORT.\nAs a seated experience with intuitive controls, first time VR users will find this game engaging and easy to play. Experienced VR users will find this game casual and relaxing.\n\nSTORY. ART. MUSIC.\nEnter a sprawling retro-futuristic cityscape with an original score, ensemble of voice actors and detailed hand drawn (in VR!) environments.\n\nGOOD \u2018OL ADVENTURE GAME\nBoot up that nostalgia for your favorite 90's point-and-click adventure games. Look around. Find items. Solve puzzles. Keep the past alive.\n\n\n* No robots were harmed in the making of this game.", "s